      "adviceAction": "FullTransfer",
      "adviceActionRationale": [
        {
          "text": "Zurich does not offer risk level 5 funds, so to achieve this profile, a blend of a risk level 7 and a risk level 2 fund has been used. As there are no multi-asset funds available within your risk range, the blend consists of the Managed AP fund (in which you are already invested) and an asset-specific fund, Interest Deposits. We would not recommend investing in single asset types, as this reduces diversification, and the blended funds have not performed as well as the options available through Aviva, albeit marginally.",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              7
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "For these reasons, we would not recommend an internal fund switch, as your main priority is to consolidate your pensions, gain better control over them, and be well-positioned for retirement with all available drawdown options.",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              7
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The receiving scheme provides more flexible retirement options, ensuring you can access your pension savings in a way that best suits your needs, including tax-efficient withdrawal strategies.",
          "isClientSpecific": false,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              7
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The new scheme allows adviser charges to be deducted directly, ensuring ongoing financial planning support without the need for separate payments.",
