      "costJustification": [
        {
          "text": "Based on a mid-growth rate of 2.94%, including our advice fees, the recommended plan would need to grow by 4.8% per year up to age 75 in order to meet the same value as your current plan. Based on the past performance of your recommended funds, I do believe that this is achievable.",
          "topic": "CriticalYieldAchievable",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "documentId": "Suitability Report Test 1.pdf",
            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice",
            "pageNumbers": [
              11
            ],
            "quote": "Based on a mid-growth rate of 2.94%, including our advice fees, the recommended plan would need to grow by 4.8% per year up to age 75 in order to meet the same value as your current plan. Based on the past performance of your recommended funds, I do believe that this is achievable."
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The recommended Aviva advised funds have demonstrated stronger performance compared to your existing Aviva holdings. However, they have not outperformed your current Zurich funds. It\u0027s important to note that your Zurich investments are allocated to higher-risk funds, which are more susceptible to market volatility, resulting in greater fluctuations in value. In contrast, the Aviva platform funds selected for you align with your agreed risk tolerance and have delivered comparable performance with reduced volatility.",
          "topic": "PerformanceJustification",
          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "documentId": "Suitability Report Test 1.pdf",
            "documentCategory": "I_RecommendationsAndAdvice",
            "pageNumbers": [
              13
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
